  m_Name: Evento_CidadePerdeCompetitividadeRegional
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Cidade Perde Competitividade Regional
  _titleEn: City Loses Regional Competitiveness
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Quando empresas e moradores trocam a cidade por vizinhas mais atraentes,
    a arrecada\xE7\xE3o cai e fica mais dif\xEDcil manter os servi\xE7os."
  _summaryEn: When companies and residents leave for more attractive neighboring
    cities, revenue falls and services become harder to maintain.
  _realWorld: "Detroit, que dependia da ind\xFAstria automobil\xEDstica, perdeu mais
    da metade da popula\xE7\xE3o desde 1950 e decretou fal\xEAncia em 2013."
  _realWorldEn: Detroit, which depended on the auto industry, lost more than half
    its population after 1950 and filed for bankruptcy in 2013.
  _tradeOffs: "Diversificar a economia e manter a qualidade dos servi\xE7os evita
    o ciclo de esvaziamento."
  _tradeOffsEn: Diversifying the economy and keeping service quality high prevents
    the cycle of decline.
  _sources:
  - Label: Detroit bankruptcy (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Detroit_bankruptcy
